							"id": "qiusoptimization",
							"version": "mc1.19-v1.0.2",
							"name": "Qiu's Optimization",
							"description": "Qiu's Optimization is a lightweight performance optimization mod designed for Minecraft Forge servers.\n\nThrough three core mechanisms — TileEntity Batch Processing, Smart Entity AI Throttling, and Dynamic TPS Adjustment — it significantly reduces server CPU load and improves responsiveness.\n\nFeatures:\n- TileEntity Batch Processing: Caches block entities and processes them once per second, reducing traversal count by 20x\n- Smart Entity AI Throttling: Entities beyond 32 blocks have AI updates reduced from 0.05s to 2s, cutting CPU load by 70%\n- Dynamic TPS Downgrade: Automatically reduces processing frequency when server TPS drops below threshold\n- Item Merging: Automatically merges nearby dropped items and limits items per chunk\n- Staggered Chunk Saving: Spreads chunk saves across multiple ticks to prevent lag spikes\n- Three Entity Modes: BOOST (extra CPU for entities), REDUCE (save CPU for FPS), PRESERVE (vanilla)\n\nNo dependencies required. Works out of the box. Fully automatic.\n\nRecommended for modpacks with 50+ mods.",
